      "id": 229,
      "start": 554.76,
      "end": 557.36,
      "en": "And now can I say take a little off the sides?",
      "zh": "现在我可以说从侧面取一点吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 230,
      "start": 557.48,
      "end": 558.48,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 231,
      "start": 558.48,
      "end": 558.6,
      "en": "You can say that as well.",
      "zh": "你也可以这么说。"
    },
    {
      "id": 232,
      "start": 559.48,
      "end": 560.48,
      "en": "Alright.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 233,
      "start": 560.48,
      "end": 561.48,
      "en": "So take a little off the top.",
      "zh": "所以从顶部取一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 234,
      "start": 561.48,
      "end": 562.52,
      "en": "Take a little off the sides.",
      "zh": "把两边取一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 235,
      "start": 563.18,
      "end": 563.66,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 236,
      "start": 563.74,
      "end": 569.82,
      "en": "So with all this great hair cutting language, why don't we listen to our dialogue one last time?",
      "zh": "那么，有了所有这些伟大的剪发语言，我们为什么不上次听我们的对话呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 237,
      "start": 575.04,
      "end": 583.12,
      "en": "Hello there.",
      "zh": "你好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 238,
      "start": 583.12,
      "end": 583.51,
      "en": "Come on in.",
      "zh": "进来吧。"
    },
    {
      "id": 239,
      "start": 584.12,
      "end": 585.03,
      "en": "Don't just stand there.",
      "zh": "别光站在那儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": 240,
      "start": 585.61,
      "end": 586.47,
      "en": "Come and take a seat.",
      "zh": "过来坐下。"
    },
    {
      "id": 241,
      "start": 587.67,
      "end": 587.95,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 242,
      "start": 588.57,
      "end": 590.25,
      "en": "Well, I just want to trim.",
      "zh": "好吧，我只是想修剪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 243,
      "start": 590.52,
      "end": 591.33,
      "en": "Nothing too fancy.",
      "zh": "不用太讲究。"
    },
    {
      "id": 244,
      "start": 594.06,
      "end": 595.48,
      "en": "Oh my gosh.",
      "zh": "我的天哪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 245,
      "start": 595.92,
      "end": 597.34,
      "en": "Your hair is amazing.",
      "zh": "你的头发真漂亮。"
    },
    {
      "id": 246,
      "start": 598.48,
      "end": 600.58,
      "en": "So silky, so shiny.",
      "zh": "如此柔滑，如此闪亮。"
    },
    {
      "id": 247,
      "start": 601.38,
      "end": 603.56,
      "en": "I am going to work my magic on your hair.",
      "zh": "我要好好施展一下手艺。"
    },
    {
      "id": 248,
      "start": 604.3,
      "end": 605.1,
      "en": "You hear me?",
      "zh": "听见我说话了吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 249,
      "start": 605.54,
      "end": 607.9,
      "en": "You are going to look like a million bucks.",
      "zh": "你会看起来像一百万美元。"
    },
    {
      "id": 250,
      "start": 609.12,
      "end": 609.66,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 251,
      "start": 611.4,
      "end": 615.38,
      "en": "Can you make sure my sideburns are even and you just take a little off the top?",
      "zh": "你能确保我的鬓角是均匀的，你只是从顶部取一点吗？"
    },
    {
      "id": 252,
      "start": 616.08,
      "end": 616.54,
      "en": "Don't you worry.",
      "zh": "你别担心。"
    },
    {
      "id": 253,
      "start": 617.08,
      "end": 618.2,
      "en": "I'll take care of everything.",
      "zh": "一切交给我处理。"
    },
    {
      "id": 254,
      "start": 619.12,
      "end": 620.22,
      "en": "Oh my God.",
      "zh": "我的天哪。"
    },
    {
      "id": 255,
      "start": 620.76,
      "end": 622.74,
      "en": "I just love your curly hair.",
      "zh": "我太喜欢你的卷发了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 256,
      "start": 623.48,
      "end": 625.22,
      "en": "It's so fluffy and cute.",
      "zh": "它是如此蓬松和可爱。"
    },
    {
      "id": 257,
      "start": 625.98,
      "end": 627.7,
      "en": "You should totally let it grow out.",
      "zh": "真应该留长一点。"
    },
    {
      "id": 258,
      "start": 628.24,
      "end": 630.84,
      "en": "An afro would look great on you.",
      "zh": "你留个爆炸头一定好看。"
    },
    {
      "id": 259,
      "start": 630.84,
      "end": 631.42,
      "en": "Um, no.",
      "zh": "嗯，不是。"
    },
    {
      "id": 260,
      "start": 632.44,
      "end": 632.6,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 261,
      "start": 633.44,
      "end": 634.82,
      "en": "But you are going to be my masterpiece.",
      "zh": "我要把你打造成我的杰作。"
    },
    {
      "id": 262,
      "start": 644.6,
      "end": 665.52,
      "en": "All right, so now talking about hairstyles and different types of hair, there are some interesting ones that maybe aren't so fashionable anymore, right?",
      "zh": "好吧，所以现在说到发型和不同类型的头发，有些有趣的头发可能不再那么时尚了，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 263,
      "start": 665.52,
      "end": 666.52,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 264,
      "start": 666.52,
      "end": 669.84,
      "en": "Actually, English has a lot of really cool words to describe haircuts.",
      "zh": "实际上，英语有很多非常酷的词来形容理发。"
    },
    {
      "id": 265,
      "start": 669.84,
      "end": 671.01,
      "en": "So let's start with a couple of them.",
      "zh": "所以让我们从其中几个开始。"
    },
    {
      "id": 266,
      "start": 671.24,
      "end": 672.17,
      "en": "For example, a mullet.",
      "zh": "例如，一个鲻鱼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 267,
      "start": 672.53,
      "end": 673.25,
      "en": "A mullet.",
      "zh": "一个鲻鱼。"
    },
    {
      "id": 268,
      "start": 673.61,
      "end": 677.79,
      "en": "So this is when your hair is really short on top and really long in the back.",
      "zh": "所以这是当你的头发在顶部很短而在后面很长的时候。"
    },
    {
      "id": 269,
      "start": 677.96,
      "end": 678.96,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 270,
      "start": 678.96,
      "end": 681.61,
      "en": "So the sides and the top are really short, but the back, you have long hair.",
      "zh": "所以两侧和顶部都很短，但背面，你有长发。"
    },
    {
      "id": 271,
      "start": 681.96,
      "end": 682.96,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 272,
      "start": 682.96,
      "end": 684.93,
      "en": "In Canada, we call that a shorty shorty long back.",
      "zh": "在加拿大，我们称之为矮个子矮个子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 273,
      "start": 685.72,
      "end": 686.71,
      "en": "Shorty shorty long back.",
      "zh": "矮个子矮个子长回来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 274,
      "start": 687.16,
      "end": 688.16,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 275,
      "start": 688.16,
      "end": 689.17,
      "en": "We also call it hockey hair.",
      "zh": "我们也称它为曲棍球头发。"
    },
    {
      "id": 276,
      "start": 689.8,
      "end": 689.99,
      "en": "Hockey hair.",
      "zh": "曲棍球头发。"
    },
    {
      "id": 277,
      "start": 690.8,
      "end": 693.49,
      "en": "Or even all business up front, all party behind.",
      "zh": "甚至是所有的业务预先，所有的聚会都在后面。"
    },
    {
      "id": 278,
      "start": 694.44,
      "end": 698.88,
      "en": "Well, Canadians are obviously very into this hairstyle.",
      "zh": "好吧，加拿大人显然非常喜欢这种发型。"
    },
    {
      "id": 279,
      "start": 698.88,
      "end": 699.69,
      "en": "It's unfortunately true.",
      "zh": "不幸的是，这是真的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 280,
      "start": 700.28,
      "end": 701.28,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 281,
      "start": 701.28,
      "end": 702.81,
      "en": "We also have, for example, a mohawk.",
      "zh": "例如，我们也有莫霍克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 282,
      "start": 703.2,
      "end": 704.2,
      "en": "Hmm.",
      "zh": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "id": 283,
      "start": 704.2,
      "end": 705.92,
      "en": "Popular amongst the punk rock kids.",
      "zh": "在朋克摇滚孩子中很受欢迎。"
    },
    {
      "id": 284,
      "start": 705.93,
      "end": 706.11,
      "en": "Exactly.",
      "zh": "正是这样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 285,
      "start": 706.65,
      "end": 712.91,
      "en": "So you shave your head on the sides, but you leave a little like stripe of long hair on top.",
      "zh": "所以你在两侧剃光头，但你在上面留下了一点长发的条纹。"
    },
    {
      "id": 286,
      "start": 713.72,
      "end": 714.72,
      "en": "Of sticking up long hair.",
      "zh": "长长的头发。"
    },
    {
      "id": 287,
      "start": 714.72,
      "end": 715.72,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 288,
      "start": 715.72,
      "end": 716.72,
      "en": "And that's a mohawk.",
      "zh": "那是莫霍克。"
    },
    {
      "id": 289,
      "start": 716.72,
      "end": 716.85,
      "en": "What about a flat top?",
      "zh": "平顶呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 290,
      "start": 717.72,
      "end": 722.08,
      "en": "Oh, popular with law enforcement agents and serial killers.",
      "zh": "哦，深受执法人员和连环杀手的欢迎。"
    },
    {
      "id": 291,
      "start": 723.28,
      "end": 725.46,
      "en": "So basically it's short hair on the sides.",
      "zh": "所以基本上是两侧的短发。"
    },
    {
      "id": 292,
      "start": 726.4,
      "end": 728.29,
      "en": "And short and flat hair on the top.",
      "zh": "顶部的短而扁平的头发。"
    },
    {
      "id": 293,
      "start": 728.48,
      "end": 729.48,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 294,
      "start": 729.48,
      "end": 730.48,
      "en": "So your hair...",
      "zh": "所以你的头发..."
    },
    {
      "id": 295,
      "start": 730.48,
      "end": 731.48,
      "en": "Kind of looks like a box.",
      "zh": "有点像一个盒子。"
    },
    {
      "id": 296,
      "start": 731.48,
      "end": 732.48,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 297,
      "start": 732.48,
      "end": 733.48,
      "en": "Like a box haircut.",
      "zh": "就像一个盒子发型。"
    },
    {
      "id": 298,
      "start": 733.48,
      "end": 736.02,
      "en": "I do not have a flat top for all of you out there.",
      "zh": "我没有给你们所有人的平顶。"
    },
    {
      "id": 299,
      "start": 737.0,
      "end": 738.61,
      "en": "But I did used to have a crew cut.",
      "zh": "但我曾经确实有过人工削减。"
    },
    {
      "id": 300,
      "start": 738.96,
      "end": 739.75,
      "en": "Oh, crew cut.",
      "zh": "哦，剪纸。"
    },
    {
      "id": 301,
      "start": 739.99,
      "end": 740.55,
      "en": "A crew cut.",
      "zh": "一个船员切割。"
    },
    {
      "id": 302,
      "start": 740.96,
      "end": 741.96,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 303,
      "start": 741.96,
      "end": 742.96,
      "en": "Like an army haircut.",
      "zh": "像军团发型。"
    },
    {
      "id": 304,
      "start": 742.96,
      "end": 743.96,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 305,
      "start": 743.96,
      "end": 746.32,
      "en": "So very short on the sides and a little bit long on top.",
      "zh": "所以两边很短，顶部有点长。"
    },
    {
      "id": 306,
      "start": 746.32,
      "end": 747.32,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 307,
      "start": 747.32,
      "end": 748.32,
      "en": "Okay.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 308,
      "start": 748.32,
      "end": 752.64,
      "en": "And our last one, my actual personal least favorite haircut.",
      "zh": "还有我们的最后一件，我个人最不喜欢的发型。"
    },
    {
      "id": 309,
      "start": 752.64,
      "end": 753.01,
      "en": "Dreadlocks.",
      "zh": "长发绺。"
    },
    {
      "id": 310,
      "start": 753.64,
      "end": 754.64,
      "en": "Dreadlocks.",
      "zh": "长发绺。"
    },
    {
      "id": 311,
      "start": 754.64,
      "end": 755.64,
      "en": "All right.",
      "zh": "好的。"
    },
    {
      "id": 312,
      "start": 755.64,
      "end": 757.61,
      "en": "So dreadlocks are like knots of hair, right?",
      "zh": "所以长发绺就像头发的结，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 313,
      "start": 758.12,
      "end": 759.12,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 314,
      "start": 759.12,
      "end": 761.47,
      "en": "Like you haven't washed your hair in about seven years.",
      "zh": "就像你已经七年没有洗头了。"
    },
    {
      "id": 315,
      "start": 762.71,
      "end": 763.31,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 316,
      "start": 763.64,
      "end": 764.64,
      "en": "Those are dreadlocks.",
      "zh": "那些是长发绺。"
    },
    {
      "id": 317,
      "start": 764.64,
      "end": 767.08,
      "en": "Very popular among Rastafarian.",
      "zh": "在拉斯塔法里安非常受欢迎。"
    },
    {
      "id": 318,
      "start": 767.96,
      "end": 768.14,
      "en": "Sure.",
      "zh": "当然。"
    },
    {
      "id": 319,
      "start": 768.62,
      "end": 770.72,
      "en": "Or like young hippie kids.",
      "zh": "或者像年轻的嬉皮士孩子一样。"
    },
    {
      "id": 320,
      "start": 771.1,
      "end": 771.28,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 321,
      "start": 771.28,
      "end": 772.28,
      "en": "Hippies, right?",
      "zh": "嬉皮士，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "id": 322,
      "start": 773.08,
      "end": 774.08,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 323,
      "start": 774.08,
      "end": 775.08,
      "en": "Very good.",
      "zh": "很好。"
    },
    {
      "id": 324,
      "start": 775.08,
      "end": 776.08,
      "en": "So what about in your countries?",
      "zh": "那么在你们的国家呢？"
    },
    {
      "id": 325,
      "start": 776.08,
      "end": 777.08,
      "en": "What different hairstyles are popular there?",
      "zh": "有哪些不同的发型流行？"
    },
    {
      "id": 326,
      "start": 777.08,
      "end": 778.64,
      "en": "I know that Japanese hairstyles are really cool.",
      "zh": "我知道日本发型真的很酷。"
    },
    {
      "id": 327,
      "start": 778.94,
      "end": 779.1,
      "en": "Yeah.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 328,
      "start": 779.2,
      "end": 779.5,
      "en": "That's right.",
      "zh": "没错。"
    },
    {
      "id": 329,
      "start": 779.82,
      "end": 781.24,
      "en": "Japanese haircuts can be pretty awesome.",
      "zh": "日本的发型可能非常棒。"
    },
    {
      "id": 330,
      "start": 781.92,
      "end": 782.92,
      "en": "Right.",
      "zh": "对。"
    },
    {
      "id": 331,
      "start": 782.92,
      "end": 783.92,
      "en": "So tell us all about it.",
      "zh": "所以告诉我们一切。"
    },
    {
      "id": 332,
      "start": 783.92,
      "end": 784.92,
      "en": "Come to our website.",
      "zh": "来我们的网站。"
    },
    {
      "id": 333,
      "start": 784.92,
      "end": 785.92,
      "en": "Post some pictures.",
      "zh": "发一些图片。"
    },
    {
      "id": 334,
      "start": 785.92,
      "end": 787.46,
      "en": "And also if you have any questions or doubts, let us know.",
      "zh": "如果您有任何疑问或疑问，请告诉我们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 335,
      "start": 787.94,
      "end": 789.52,
      "en": "Well, thanks for downloading this lesson, you guys.",
      "zh": "好吧，感谢您下载本课，你们。"
    },
    {
      "id": 336,
      "start": 789.78,
      "end": 791.94,
      "en": "And until next time, goodbye.",
      "zh": "下次再见，拜拜。"
    }
  ],
